{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_worker_mesh_worker_mesh", "label": "Worker-Mesh", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/worker-mesh.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "JavaScript ist pro Actor-System single-threaded; f\u00fcr Parallelit\u00e4t in einem OS-Prozess laufen mehrere ActorSystems \u2014 eines pro Worker-Thread \u2014 im selben Cluster \u00fcber MessageChannel, ohne TCP und ohne Serialisierung zu Bytes."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_worker_mesh_workercluster", "label": "WorkerCluster", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/worker-mesh.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Automatisiert Broker, Kan\u00e4le und Handshake; das Worker-Primitiv wird pro Runtime gew\u00e4hlt. spawn() l\u00e4sst bei einem Fehlschlag keine lebenden Worker zur\u00fcck."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_worker_mesh_workernode_join", "label": "WorkerNode.join()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/worker-mesh.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aus einer async main() aufrufen: auf Bun suspendiert ein Top-Level-await im Worker den Modul-Loader, sodass der Handshake f\u00fcr immer h\u00e4ngt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_worker_mesh_workerbroker", "label": "WorkerBroker", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/worker-mesh.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Broker als Nabe h\u00e4lt einen MessagePort pro Node; N Worker brauchen N Channels, nicht binomial(N,2), zum Preis, dass der Hauptthread Relay f\u00fcr allen Node-\u00fcbergreifenden Verkehr wird."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_worker_mesh_messagechanneltransport", "label": "MessageChannelTransport", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/worker-mesh.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_worker_mesh_star_topology", "label": "Ein Stern, kein voll vermaschtes Mesh", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/worker-mesh.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_worker_mesh_failure_containment", "label": "Fehler-Containment", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/worker-mesh.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Das Framework abonniert das error-Event des Workers auf jeder Runtime; ohne dieses Abonnement wirft Node den Fehler erneut im Host und Deno rejected eine interne Promise \u2014 beide beenden sich mit 1, bevor restartPolicy gefragt wird."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_worker_mesh_restart_budget", "label": "Respawn-Backoff und Restart-Budget", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/worker-mesh.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Slot bekommt maxRestarts innerhalb von restartWindowMs mit exponentiellem Backoff und Jitter; ein Ersatz, der nie ready wird, z\u00e4hlt gegen dasselbe Budget, ein dauerhaft defektes Bootstrap h\u00f6rt also auf, statt zu schleifen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_worker_mesh_structured_clone", "label": "Structured Clone \u00fcber postMessage", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/worker-mesh.mdx", "source_location": null, 